---
import {path,speakerContact} from '../../data/site';
const names=['Orlando Denegri','Stefanny Berdejo','Dr. Bayter','Wilfredo Guevara','Jorge Loza','Regina Carrot','Héctor Raúl González'];
---
<section class="shared-stage" aria-labelledby="shared-stage-title"><div class="presence-wrap shared-stage-layout"><div class="shared-stage-copy"><p class="presence-kicker">UN RECORRIDO DE ENCUENTROS</p><h2 id="shared-stage-title">Con quién he<br /><span>compartido escenario.</span></h2><p class="shared-stage-intro">Personas que forman parte de los eventos y escenarios de mi recorrido.</p><ul class="shared-stage-names">{names.map(name=><li>{name}</li>)}</ul><p class="shared-stage-context">Compartir escenario no implica aval de mis servicios, del método POWER 4 ni una alianza comercial.</p><a class="presence-link" href={speakerContact}>Hablemos del próximo escenario <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><figure class="shared-stage-portrait"><img src={`${path()}images/experience/juanca-presencia-720.webp`} srcset={`${path()}images/experience/juanca-presencia-360.webp 360w, ${path()}images/experience/juanca-presencia-720.webp 720w`} sizes="(max-width:1024px) 30vw, 360px" width="1600" height="2400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="JuanCa Power sonríe durante una conferencia, con micrófono de diadema." /><figcaption>JuanCa Power · Fotografía de su actividad como speaker</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<style>
.shared-stage{background:#0b0d17;color:#f8f9fa;padding:96px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #343b50}.shared-stage-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr;gap:88px;align-items:center}.shared-stage h2{font-size:clamp(32px,3.7vw,52px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:20px 0 24px}.shared-stage h2 span{color:#f1e5ac}.shared-stage-intro{max-width:500px;color:#b7bdce;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8}.shared-stage-names{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 28px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:32px 0 26px}.shared-stage-names li{border-bottom:1px solid #343b50;padding:21px 0;font-size:clamp(20px,1.9vw,26px);line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:500}.shared-stage-context{color:#b7bdce;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;max-width:550px;margin-bottom:28px}.shared-stage-portrait{margin:0;align-self:start;padding-top:18px}.shared-stage-portrait img{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 22%}.shared-stage-portrait figcaption{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#b7bdce;margin-top:14px}
@media(max-width:1024px){.shared-stage-layout{gap:40px;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr}.shared-stage-names{gap:0 20px}.shared-stage-names li{font-size:21px}.shared-stage-portrait{align-self:center}}
@media(max-width:700px){.shared-stage{padding:64px 0}.shared-stage-layout{display:block}.shared-stage h2{font-size:34px}.shared-stage-names{gap:0 18px;margin-top:26px}.shared-stage-names li{font-size:20px;padding:18px 0}.shared-stage-portrait{display:none}.shared-stage-intro{font-size:15px}.shared-stage-context{font-size:11px}.shared-stage .presence-link{font-size:14px}}
</style>
